    feat(node-local-persistent-volume): report the declared volume in alloc status and describe
    
    The alloc_status handler projects the workload's declared [vm.volume] onto
    AllocStatusResponse.volume at read time, and render::workload_describe
    prints a presence-guarded Volume line with the size and the static guest
    disk serial. The OpenAPI spec is regenerated, and the README's quoted
    describe line matches the real output.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Step-Id: 02-04
    Task-Id: node-local-persistent-volume

